        "desc": "The person from the reference images, standing tall and relaxed with the weight on one leg, one hand resting easily on the rail of the billiard table and the other in a trouser pocket, shoulders open, chin level, a slow confident closed-mouth smile, direct gaze to the lens.",
        "color_palette": [
          "#F1EEE7",
          "#D6DEE6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [
