    "lighting": "Bright natural daylight flooding in through the car window behind and to one side, rimming the edge of the face and hair, with soft neutral bounce from the car interior filling the shadow side. Slightly blown highlights outside the window, face still correctly exposed.",
    "photo": "Modern smartphone front camera: mild wide-angle perspective, punchy natural colour, gentle HDR, fine digital noise in the shadows, sharp on the face.",
